            "refusal_point": "profile-compilation",
            "diagnostic_code": "model.adapter.credential-missing",
            "summary": "Local Lite builds the Anthropic adapter when ZERO_AR_ADAPTER=anthropic and a key arrives through protected input, the OS credential store or ANTHROPIC_API_KEY; startup refuses without a key, and egress is admitted only to that adapter's host. Its release claim follows UAT-CV-017."
          },
